tes by Stan Kenton</a></i> (1950–53)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Kenton_Era\" title=\"The Kenton Era\">The Kenton Era</a></i> (1950–51)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Innovations_Orchestra\" title=\"The Innovations Orchestra\">The Innovations Orchestra</a></i> (1950–51)</li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">With<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Pete_Rugolo\" title=\"Pete Rugolo\">Pete<br />Rugolo</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Introducing_Pete_Rugolo\" title=\"Introducing Pete Rugolo\">Introducing Pete Rugolo</a></i> (1954)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Adventures_in_Rhythm\" title=\"Adventures in Rhythm\">Adventures in Rhythm</a></i> (1954)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Rugolomania\" title=\"Rugolomania\">Rugolomania</a></i> (1954–55)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/New_Sounds_by_Pete_Rugolo\" title=\"New Sounds by Pete Rugolo\">New Sounds by Pete Rugolo</a></i> (1954–55)</li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">Sideman<br />with<br />others</th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Collaboration_West\" title=\"Collaboration West\">Collaboration West</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Teddy_Charles\" title=\"Teddy Charles\">Teddy Charles</a>, 1952–53)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Evolution_(Teddy_Charles_album)\" title=\"Evolution (Teddy Charles album)\">Evolution</a></i> (Teddy Charles,1953–55)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Jimmy_Giuffre_(album)\" title=\"Jimmy Giuffre (album)\">Jimmy Giuffre</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Jimmy_Giuffre\" title=\"Jimmy Giuffre\">Jimmy Giuffre</a>, 1954–55)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Jimmy_Giuffre_Clarinet\" title=\"The Jimmy Giuffre Clarinet\">The Jimmy Giuffre Clarinet</a></i> (Jimmy Giuffre, 1956)</li></ul>\n